  "notes": [
    "Manual behavior takes precedence over SDK implementation idioms.",
    "All three UART source C files have identical tokens after removing comments, whitespace, line continuations and replacing the family identifier.",
    "The SDK uses a read-modify-write macro for ICR. This HAL instead writes the documented reset word with only selected real R1W0 flags cleared.",
    "Only standard asynchronous PCLK-clocked 8-bit operation is ported; no LIN, timer/timeout, auto-baud, LSI/LSE, synchronous mode, hardware flow control or DMA is exposed.",
    "AF and package-bonding verification are separate from the register audit."
  ]
